{
  "id": "019-brain-energy",
  "title": "2% of your weight, 20% of your energy",
  "format": "short",
  "theme": "body",
  "voice": "af_heart",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Your brain is about 2% of your body weight, but it burns around 20% of your energy.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "compare",
        "unit": "%",
        "left": {
          "label": "body weight",
          "value": 2
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "energy used",
          "value": 20
        }
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "2%",
        "20%"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That's even when you're resting, doing nothing at all.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "icon",
        "names": [
          "bed"
        ],
        "label": "even at rest"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "resting,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In power terms, that's roughly 20 watts.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "number",
        "value": 20,
        "label": "watts, roughly",
        "suffix": " W"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "20",
        "watts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "About the same as a dim light bulb, running nonstop inside your head.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "icon",
        "names": [
          "star"
        ],
        "label": "a dim light bulb"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "light",
        "bulb,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No other organ uses so much for its size.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "words",
        "words": [
          "the",
          "hungriest",
          "organ"
        ]
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "hungriest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you feel drained after hard thinking, there's a real cost behind it.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "icon",
        "names": [
          "brain"
        ],
        "label": "thinking costs fuel"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "drained"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Your brain never fully switches off, not even while you sleep.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "words",
        "words": [
          "never",
          "off"
        ]
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "never"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty watts. That's what it takes to run you.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "number",
        "value": 20,
        "label": "watts to run you",
        "suffix": " W"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "Twenty",
        "watts."
      ]
    }
  ],
